 "Start here": "Welcome.title",
 "The job, in order": "Welcome.title",
 "Why cutting is the whole game": "Welcome.title",
 "On the corner": "Welcome.title",
 "The police": "Welcome.title",
 "Who is who": "Welcome.title",
 "The rest of the phone": "Welcome.title",
 "If you remember three things": "Welcome.title",
 "Go and see Gerald": "Welcome.row",
 "The flats on Grove": "Welcome.row",
 "He is the only marker on your map, and that is deliberate. He puts the first lot of product in your hand for nothing, so you do not need money to get going": "Welcome.row",
 "Open the phone": "Welcome.row",
 "The phone button": "Welcome.row",
 "Everything in here lives on it. Arrows move, Enter opens, Backspace goes back a screen. There is nothing else to learn about the controls": "Welcome.row",
 "Sell what he gave you": "Welcome.row",
 "Dealing > Post up": "Welcome.row",
 "Walk somewhere with people about, open the phone and post up. Buyers come to you. When it is all gone he will text you to come back": "Welcome.row",
 "1. Get hold of some": "Welcome.row",
 "Gangs > your leader": "Welcome.row",
 "Gerald hands you the first two lots free. After that you buy it -- from him, or from the man at the port once you have met him": "Welcome.row",
 "2. Bag it up": "Welcome.row",
 "The kitchen at Denise's": "Welcome.row",
 "Anything you BUY comes as weight and will not sell as it is. It has to go to the sink first. Anything you are GIVEN is already bagged": "Welcome.row",
 "3. Stand somewhere": "Welcome.row",
 "You choose the SPOT, not who to sell to. A busy pavement sells fast and an empty street sells nothing, however good the gear is": "Welcome.row",
 "4. Do not still be there": "Welcome.row",
 "Watch your heat": "Welcome.row",
 "Every sale gets you noticed a bit more. Stay on one corner long enough and somebody makes a phone call": "Welcome.row",
 "Weight will not sell": "Welcome.row",
 "Bricks and bags are not product": "Welcome.row",
 "You cannot hand somebody a brick on a street corner. It has to be worked and bagged before anybody will take it": "Welcome.row",
 "Use the sink at Denise's": "Welcome.row",
 "Walk up to the counter": "Welcome.row",
 "It is in the kitchen at her place. Standing at it offers you the job": "Welcome.row",
 "Decide how far to stretch it": "Welcome.row",
 "100% down to 25%": "Welcome.row",
 "Cut to half and you come out with twice as much. Cut to a quarter and you have four times as much, and it is obviously rubbish": "Welcome.row",
 "cut_50.png": "Welcome.row",
 "What comes out is ready": "Welcome.row",
 "Bagged and sellable": "Welcome.row",
 "That is what a corner takes. It is the only thing a corner takes": "Welcome.row",
 "Cutting makes more of it": "Welcome.row",
 "100g at 50% = 200g": "Welcome.row",
 "Same money in, twice as much to sell. There is a reason everybody does it": "Welcome.row",
 "People can tell": "Welcome.row",
 "Weak gear gets refused": "Welcome.row",
 "A refusal is not just one lost sale. They remember it, they tell people, and some of them want to do something about it": "Welcome.row",
 "Your name is a number": "Welcome.row",
 "It moves on every sale": "Welcome.row",
 "Sell decent stuff for a while and it climbs. Step on everything and it does not. That trade is the game": "Welcome.row",
 "You can wander": "Welcome.row",
 "About forty metres": "Welcome.row",
 "Cross the road, step round the back of the block -- the pitch holds. Go further than that and you have packed up": "Welcome.row",
 "They ask for an amount": "Welcome.row",
 "A gram, an eighth, an ounce": "Welcome.row",
 "Different people want different amounts, and what one block pays is not what the next one pays": "Welcome.row",
 "Heat sticks to the place": "Welcome.row",
 "Not to you": "Welcome.row",
 "Come back to the same corner and you pick up where you left it. A different block is a clean start, and a quiet corner cools off": "Welcome.row",
 "The block hears about it": "Welcome.row",
 "Posting up puts the word out, in the sort of language that does not say anything outright. That is how anybody knows to come": "Welcome.row",
 "They drive your block anyway": "Welcome.row",
 "This is not a wanted level": "Welcome.row",
 "A car comes past, has a look, moves on. It happens whether or not anybody is after you": "Welcome.row",
 "A hot corner draws them": "Welcome.row",
 "They come to the noise": "Welcome.row",
 "Work one spot long enough and they stop driving past and start stopping": "Welcome.row",
 "It is what you are carrying": "Welcome.row",
 "They search, they do not arrest": "Welcome.row",
 "Get searched holding product and they take it. Hold nothing and it is only a fine -- which is why getting rid of a bag before they reach you works": "Welcome.row",
 "You can tell them what you think": "Welcome.row",
 "Right on the d-pad": "Welcome.row",
 "Stood near a patrol car with no wanted level, put a finger up at them. Nothing they can do you for, and they know it": "Welcome.row",
 "Gerald": "Welcome.row",
 "Where you begin. He gives you a package, you move all of it, you bring him the money. Do that twice and he tells you where it comes from. He deals PILLS -- bars first, then rolls": "Welcome.row",
 "Lamar": "Welcome.row",
 "Forum Drive, once you are in": "Welcome.row",
 "The work: rides, hits, drive-bys, tagging. He opens jobs up as your name gets bigger, and he runs the weed side rather than pills": "Welcome.row",
 "Tao Cheng": "Welcome.row",
 "Elysian Island": "Welcome.row",
 "The port, and the reason Gerald's two packages matter. He sells by the brick, and once you know him he drives it to wherever you are standing": "Welcome.row",
 "Hao": "Welcome.row",
 "The lot in Little Seoul": "Welcome.row",
 "Cars, all of them on competition suspension. Anything you buy off him is yours and stays where you leave it": "Welcome.row",
 "Stretch": "Welcome.row",
 "The rack": "Welcome.row",
 "Guns, with extended mags on everything he sells": "Welcome.row",
 "Everybody else": "Welcome.row",
 "Gangs": "Welcome.row",
 "Eight more sets, each with a leader standing somewhere, each hidden on your map until you have actually met him. Standing is tracked per gang": "Welcome.row",
 "Dealing": "Welcome.row",
 "Buy, bag, post up": "Welcome.row",
 "The product side of it, and where the corner is started and stopped": "Welcome.row",
 "Who you run with": "Welcome.row",
 "Your leader, your standing, and the eight sets you do not run with": "Welcome.row",
 "What the block is saying": "Welcome.row",
 "It reacts to what you actually do, and you can say something back": "Welcome.row",
 "Settings": "Welcome.row",
 "Everything is adjustable": "Welcome.row",
 "Difficulty, prices, what shows on screen -- and a switch to start the whole thing over if you want a clean run": "Welcome.row",
 "Go to Gerald first": "Welcome.row",
 "He is on your map now. Everything else opens up behind him": "Welcome.row",
 "Bought weight has to be bagged": "Welcome.row",
 "Before it will sell": "Welcome.row",
 "The sink at Denise's. This is the one that catches people out": "Welcome.row",
 "Do not get comfortable": "Welcome.row",
 "Move corners": "Welcome.row",
 "The money is in selling out and being gone before anybody makes it their business": "Welcome.row",
 "~g~Your pieces are still yours.~s~  ": "GunLocker.glue",
