 "The gangs": "WheelPages.label",
 "Every standing, every body, every dollar you made them, and whoever you run with. Respect, money and product untouched": "WheelPages.note",
 "Lamar's work": "WheelPages.label",
 "He works down his list from the top again. What he already paid you stays paid": "WheelPages.note",
 "Your graffiti": "WheelPages.label",
 "Every tag you have sprayed comes off the walls, and off the save with it. The walls go back to how the game had them": "WheelPages.note",
 "Hot blocks": "WheelPages.label",
 "Every corner you have made hot forgets it. The city starts cold again": "WheelPages.note",
 "Gerald's packages": "WheelPages.label",
 "Both fronts back on the table and the port shut again, so his whole sequence runs from the top. What you already sold stays sold": "WheelPages.note",
 "Finish Gerald's package": "WheelPages.label",
 "Counts what he's fronted you as sold without selling it, so he gets in touch and you can hand it in. Skips the audition, so the set will take you. Press it again for the second one and the port opens up": "WheelPages.note",
 "Count Gerald's packages done": "WheelPages.label",
 "Marks both of his fronts as moved without moving them. For a save that cleared one and was not credited for it -- he opens up the port instead of asking again": "WheelPages.note",
 "Trigger": "WheelPages.label",
 "The dog forgets he is yours and goes back to the yard, ready to be petted again. For a dog that is lost, stuck, or on a save that thinks you have one when you cannot find him": "WheelPages.note",
 "Your socials": "WheelPages.label",
 "Followers back to nobody and the timeline cleared. The block carries on talking; it stops knowing who you are": "WheelPages.note",
 "Unlock everything": "WheelPages.label",
 "Every job marked done, every leader met, the port open, Gerald's packages cleared and the rank to match. For seeing the far end of the mod without playing the near end again": "WheelPages.note",
 "Unlock Lamar's work": "WheelPages.label",
 "Every job on his list open at once. He works the list in order, so this marks them all as done -- and a done job still shows on his list as one you can run again": "WheelPages.note",
 "Start the mod over": "WheelPages.label",
 "Everything this mod has written down, gone -- standing, rank, record, unlocks, contacts and the stash with them. Your money and your guns are the game's, not ours, so they stay": "WheelPages.note",
 "Your name": "WheelPages.label",
 "Respect to nothing, and the rank with it. Deals, grams and earnings forgotten": "WheelPages.note",
 "Your money": "WheelPages.label",
 "The cash in hand. Not the bank and not anything you own": "WheelPages.note",
 "Your guns": "WheelPages.label",
 "Every weapon and every round. You keep your fists": "WheelPages.note",
 "What you're carrying": "WheelPages.label",
 "Everything in your pockets, bagged and raw. The house is a separate row": "WheelPages.note",
 "The stash house": "WheelPages.label",
 "Everything kept at the house. What is on you stays in your pockets": "WheelPages.note",
 "All of it": "WheelPages.label",
 "Gangs, jobs, socials, your name, your money, your guns and every gram. None of it comes back": "WheelPages.note",
